    // Task #110 — section reframed from "feature catalog" to "what
    // changes Monday morning" (outcome-led, jobs-to-be-done).
    landingFeaturesTag: "What changes Monday morning",
    landingFeaturesTitle: "Six ways life gets easier.",
    landingFeaturesSub: "BonBox isn't \"another bookkeeping app.\" It's the layer that turns 12 separate panic-moments a week — close, MOMS, faktura chase, revisor email, weekend staff — into one calm rhythm.",
    // 6 outcome-led cards.  Title = what the owner FEELS change.
    // Body = the underlying mechanism so they trust the promise.
    landingFeatBriefTitle: "Open the app at 8 and already know what to do.",
    landingFeatBriefBody: "The 8am Daily Brief lands with yesterday's revenue, MOMS countdown, overdue invoices, regulars drifting away, recurring bills due. Each insight is one tap to fix. You'll re-find the morning rhythm you lost.",
    landingFeatHeroTitle: "Close the till in 30 seconds. Go home.",
    landingFeatHeroBody: "Snap the Z-report, BonBox reads the numbers. Four taps — revenue, payments, cash, review. Kasserapport is signed, locked, and ready for SKAT. Saves the 20 minutes of typing you do every night.",
    landingFeatFakturaTitle: "Get paid faster. Chase less.",
    landingFeatFakturaBody: "Send fakturaer in one click — numbering that runs without gaps. Bank deposits auto-match to open invoices on the next CSV. Overdue ones surface in the morning Brief before they become a phone call.",
    landingFeatBankTitle: "Stop typing receipts into Excel.",
    landingFeatBankBody: "Snap a kvittering with your phone — receipt OCR fills the expense in 4 seconds. Upload your netbank CSV — BonBox matches incoming payments to open fakturaer with confidence tiers. The Excel sheet your bookkeeper hates? Gone.",
    landingFeatStaffTitle: "Stop guessing on weekend staffing.",
    landingFeatStaffBody: "Schedule autopilot reads the weather forecast, your last 8 weeks of revenue, and DK labor law — proposes next week in one tap. Tweak per shift, publish. Pro-tier cafés save 5–10% on labor without overworking the crew.",
    landingFeatRevisorTitle: "Your revisor stops calling.",
    landingFeatRevisorBody: "Invite your bogholder by email — they get a read-only login, every action audit-logged. No password sharing, no GDPR risk, no monthly \"send me the CSVs\" email. SAF-T + kasserapport + faktura, ready for them whenever.",
    // Task #171 — focused premium capabilities showcase.  Replaces the old
    // 6-card "Six ways" grid with 9 core capabilities, each a calm row
    // (Lucide icon in a soft gray tile + bold title + ONE honest benefit
    // line).  HONESTY: MOMS line = owner submits to SKAT; faktura line =
    // matching is from the uploaded netbank CSV, not a live bank feed.
    landingCapTag: "What BonBox does",
    landingCapTitle: "A few powerful things, done properly.",
    landingCapSub: "Not 30 half-finished features fighting for your attention. The core of running a Danish small business — close, MOMS, faktura, staff, your revisor — each built to actually carry its weight.",
    landingCapBriefTitle: "8am Daily Brief",
    landingCapBriefBody: "Open the app at 8 and already know your day: revenue, MOMS countdown, overdue invoices, regulars drifting away.",
    landingCapCloseTitle: "30-second daily close",
    landingCapCloseBody: "Photograph the Z-report, check the numbers, and the kasserapport is dated, locked and ready for your revisor before you lock up.",
    landingCapMomsTitle: "MOMS on autopilot",
    landingCapMomsBody: "A live countdown to every frist, and a PDF with the numbers ready for the filing. You submit to SKAT yourself.",
    landingCapFakturaTitle: "Faktura that gets paid",
    landingCapFakturaBody: "One-click invoices with numbering that runs without gaps. Upload your netbank CSV and deposits are matched to open fakturaer for you.",
    landingCapOcrTitle: "Receipt OCR",
    landingCapOcrBody: "Photograph a kvittering and the expense is filled in for you in seconds: vendor, amount, date, MOMS. No more typing receipts into Excel.",
    landingCapStaffTitle: "Staff schedule autopilot",
    landingCapStaffBody: "Next week's roster from the weather forecast, your own revenue, and DK labour law — proposed in one tap. Tweak per shift, publish.",
    landingCapReservationsTitle: "Reservations",
    landingCapReservationsBody: "Take bookings online and arrange your floor on a visual plan — so the same table never gets double-booked.",
    landingCapInventoryTitle: "Inventory",
    landingCapInventoryBody: "Low-stock and expiry alerts before you run out, with a per-channel breakdown across Wolt, Uber Eats and Foodora.",
    landingCapRevisorTitle: "Your revisor, read-only",
    landingCapRevisorBody: "Invite your bogholder to a read-only login where every action is audit-logged. No more \"send me the CSVs.\"",
